      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000053",
      "name": "Write SO Rows to Excel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [2020, 660]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const invoiceRows = $('Build Invoice Rows').all();\nconst soRows = $('Build Sales Order Rows').all();\nconst now = new Date().toISOString();\n\nconst totalInvoiceAmt = invoiceRows.reduce((s, r) => s + Number(r.json['Amount'] || 0), 0);\nconst uniqueCustomers = [...new Set(invoiceRows.map(r => r.json['Customer No']).filter(Boolean))];\nconst uniqueItems = [...new Set(invoiceRows.map(r => r.json['Item No']).filter(Boolean))];\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  message: `Excel updated at ${now}`,\n  invoiceLineCount: invoiceRows.length,\n  salesOrderCount: soRows.length,\n  totalInvoiceAmount: totalInvoiceAmt.toFixed(2),\n  uniqueCustomers: uniqueCustomers.length,\n  uniqueItems: uniqueItems.length\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000060",
      "name": "Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2260, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trigger & Auth\nSchedule: Daily at 6 AM\nManual: Click to test\n\nGets two OAuth2 tokens:\n1. BC token (Business Central OData)\n2. Graph token (SharePoint Excel write)",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 280
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000070",
      "name": "Note: Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-240, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BC Data Fetch\nFetches three datasets in parallel:\n1. **Invoice Lines** – all item-type lines YTD\n2. **Invoice Headers** – PO #, delivery dates\n3. **Open Sales Orders** – current open/released",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 200
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000071",
      "name": "Note: BC Fetch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Excel Write (SharePoint)\nClears old data, writes fresh rows.\n\n**InvoiceLines** sheet: Item, Description, Invoice #, Customer, Qty, Price, Amount, SO #, PO #, Dates\n\n**OpenSalesOrders** sheet: Order #, Customer, PO #, Status, Delivery Date",
        "width": 800,
        "height": 200
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000072",
      "name": "Note: Excel Write",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1240, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP REQUIRED\n\n1. In **Configure SharePoint IDs** node, set:\n   - `SHAREPOINT_SITE_ID`\n   - `DRIVE_ID`\n   - `EXCEL_FILE_ITEM_ID`\n\n2. Your Azure AD app needs the scope:\n   `https://graph.microsoft.com/.default`\n   with **Files.ReadWrite.All** permission\n\n3. Upload `Route21_Pricing_Report.xlsx` to SharePoint first\n\n4. Get the IDs via Graph Explorer:\n   `GET /sites/{host}:/sites/{site}`\n   `GET /sites/{id}/drives`\n   `GET /drives/{id}/root/children`",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 380
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000073",
      "name": "Note: Setup Required",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [380, 860]
    }
